  ('ev-rule-cs-46b', 'prerequisite_rule', 'sjsu-2026-27-cs-46b-prereq', 'https://www.sjsu.edu/cs/docs/syllabi/fall26/CS46B_Introduction_to_Data_Structures_Fall_2026_section_1_Luo.pdf', 'CS 46B official SJSU syllabus', 'CS 46A or CS 46AX (with grade of C- or better). If CS 46A was not in Java, CS 46AW also required. Math Enrollment Category M-I or M-II and satisfactory score on the Precalculus Proficiency Assessment (70 or higher), or MATH 19 with C- or better, or MATH 18A and MATH 18B with C- or better; allowed majors only.', '2026-09-25 07:30:00+00', 'confirmed', 'Published in the official Fall 2026 syllabus; catalog course page itself was inaccessible.'),
